{"unit_id":4,"stage_id":4,"lesson":{"lesson_id":7,"lesson_key":"S4L7","stage_id":4,"title":"Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","en":"Prepositions with Attached Pronoun (In your house): بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","ur":"حرفِ جر بمع ضمیر: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-जर्र ब-ज़मीर: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ"},"arabic_Focus":"بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","hinglish_Focus":"Tera ghar → Tere ghar mein","page_numbers":"17–19","book_page":17,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","hinglish":"Tera ghar → Tere ghar mein","arabic_word":"بَيْتُكَ","arabic_combined":"بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","hinglish_word":"Tera ghar","hinglish_combined":"Tera ghar → Tere ghar mein","title_en":"Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ","subtitle":"Unit 4 • Lesson 7 (Book Page 17–19)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"بَيْتُكَ","after_ar":"فِي بَيْتِكَ","before_hi":"Tera ghar","after_hi":"Tere ghar mein"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S4L7 — Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S4L7 — Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["Harf-e-Jarr + Ism + ـكَ","فِي بَيْتِكَ / مِنْ رَبِّكَ / إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ","Tere ghar mein / Aapke Rabb ki taraf se / Aapke Rabb ki taraf"],["إِنَّ + Ism + ـكَ","إِنَّ رَبَّكَ / إِنَّ صَلَاتَكَ","Beshak aapka Rabb / Beshak aapki namaz"],["Izaafat + رَبِّكَ","رَحْمَةُ رَبِّكَ / صِرَاطُ رَبِّكَ / عَذَابُ رَبِّكَ","Aapke Rabb ki rahmat / raasta / azaab"]]}},{"id":"sec_s4l7_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer: بَيْتُكَ ← فِي بَيْتِكَ (Page 17–19)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتُكَ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Jarr + ـكَ</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">فِي بَيْتِكَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتُكَ (Tera ghar) se فِي بَيْتِكَ (Tere ghar mein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 17–19):** Jab `ـكَ` wale ism se pehle Harf-e-Jarr (`فِي`، `مِنْ`، `إِلَىٰ`، `بِـ`، `عَلَىٰ`، `عَنْ`) ya Mudaaf aata hai toh `ـكَ` se pehle wale harf ke neeche Zair (`ـِ`) aa jati hai (`فِي بَيْتِكَ`، `مِنْ رَبِّكَ`، `رَحْمَةُ رَبِّكَ`), aur `إِنَّ` aane par Zabar aata hai (`إِنَّ رَبَّكَ وَاسِعُ الْمَغْفِرَةِ`). Isi sabaq mein Harf-e-Jarr `عَنْ` ('se / ke baare mein') ki exercise bhi shamil hai."}},{"id":"sec_s4l7_g2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l7_g2_w1","arabic":"مِنْ رَبِّكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Aapke Rabb ki taraf se","translations":{"en":"From your Lord","ur":"آپ کے رب کی طرف سے","hi":"आपके रब की तरफ़ से"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w2","arabic":"مِنْ بَيْتِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Tere ghar se","translations":{"en":"From your house","ur":"تیرے گھر سے","hi":"तेरे घर से"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w3","arabic":"مِنْ قَوْمِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Teri qom se","translations":{"en":"From your people","ur":"تیری قوم سے","hi":"तेरी क़ौम से"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w4","arabic":"مِنْ جَنَّتِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَنَّتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Teri jannat se","translations":{"en":"From your garden","ur":"تیرے باغ (جنت) سے","hi":"तेरे बाग़ (जन्नत) से"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w5","arabic":"مِنْ أَهْلِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَهْلِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Tere ghar-walon se","translations":{"en":"From your family","ur":"تیرے گھر والوں سے","hi":"तेरे घर वालों से"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w6","arabic":"مِنْ ذَنْبِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <spa