ass=\"arabic-root\">ضَلَالِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Teri gumrahi mein","translations":{"en":"In your error","ur":"تیری گمراہی میں","hi":"तेरी गुमराही में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w14","arabic":"فِي نَفْسِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَفْسِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Tere nafs mein","translations":{"en":"Within yourself","ur":"تیرے نفس میں","hi":"तेरे नफ़्स में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w15","arabic":"فِي مَنَامِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَنَامِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Tere khwab mein","translations":{"en":"In your dream","ur":"تیرے خواب میں","hi":"तेरे ख़्वाब में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w16","arabic":"فِي يَمِينِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَمِينِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Tere daayein hath mein","translations":{"en":"In your right hand","ur":"تیرے دائیں ہاتھ میں","hi":"तेरे दाएं हाथ में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w17","arabic":"فِي جَيْبِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَيْبِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Aapke girehbaan mein","translations":{"en":"In your collar (pocket)","ur":"آپ کے گریبان میں","hi":"आपके गरेबान में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w18","arabic":"فِي مَشْيِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَشْيِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Teri chaal mein","translations":{"en":"In your walking","ur":"تیری چال میں","hi":"तेरी चाल में"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w19","arabic":"إِلَى رَبِّكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كَ</span>","hinglish":"Aapke Rabb ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To your Lord","ur":"آپ کے رب کی طرف","hi":"आपके रब की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s4l7_g2_w20","arabic":"إِلَى إِلَهِكَ","arabic_markup":"<